OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy with outbreaks of heavy
OL,6,Frain in the early morning. This rain
OL,7,Fwill turn showery from mid-morning
OL,8,Fwith these showers becoming isolated
OL,9,Fduring the afternoon.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FThe evening will become
OL,12,Fmostly dry with only a chance of an
OL,13,Fodd shower. The night will then
OL,14,Fcontinue dry with clear periods.
OL,15,
OL,16,CSunday:FDry with bright or sunny
OL,17,Fspells in the morning becoming cloudy
OL,18,Ffrom the early afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
