OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,6,FOutbreaks of locally heavy rain spread
OL,7,Fsoutheast Monday afternoon. Scattered
OL,8,Fshowers clear from Tuesday evening.
OL,9,FShowery rain, some heavy or thundery
OL,10,Fspreads east late Wednesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
